#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:4
msgid "Editor setup"
msgstr "编辑器配置"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:6
msgid ""
"Editor setup is optional and is not required to run Isaac Lab. The "
"repository includes shared settings for `Visual Studio Code "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/>`_ and compatible editors such as `Cursor "
"<https://www.cursor.com/>`_. Complete one of the :ref:`Isaac Lab "
"installation methods <isaaclab-installation-root>` before configuring your "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"编辑器配置是可选步骤，运行 Isaac Lab 无需配置编辑器。仓库提供了 `Visual Studio Code "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/>`_ 及 `Cursor <https://www.cursor.com/>`_ "
"等兼容编辑器的共享设置。配置前，先完成一种 :ref:`Isaac Lab 安装方式 <isaaclab-installation-root>` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:12
msgid "The ``.vscode`` directory contains the checked-in templates and tasks:"
msgstr "``.vscode`` 目录包含已纳入版本控制的模板和任务："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:26
msgid "Configure a source checkout"
msgstr "配置源码检出目录"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:28
msgid ""
"Open the Isaac Lab repository root in your editor. Then run the setup "
"command that matches your installation from a terminal in that directory."
msgstr "在编辑器中打开 Isaac Lab 仓库根目录，再从该目录的终端运行与你的安装方式对应的配置命令。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid "uv (recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:35
msgid "For the default Newton environment, run:"
msgstr "默认 Newton 环境使用："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:41
msgid ""
"If you use Isaac Sim from the ``isaacsim`` extra, include the extra so the "
"setup command can discover its extensions:"
msgstr "如果通过 ``isaacsim`` 可选依赖组使用 Isaac Sim，需包含该依赖组，使配置命令能发现其扩展："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid "Activated Python environment"
msgstr "已激活的 Python 环境"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:50
msgid ""
"Activate the uv, venv, or conda environment where Isaac Lab is installed, "
"then run:"
msgstr "激活已安装 Isaac Lab 的 uv、venv 或 conda 环境，再运行："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid "Downloaded Isaac Sim package"
msgstr "下载的 Isaac Sim 软件包"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:59
msgid ""
"Run the setup command through the Isaac Lab launcher after completing the "
":ref:`downloaded package installation <isaaclab-binaries-installation>`:"
msgstr ""
"完成 :ref:`下载软件包安装 <isaaclab-binaries-installation>` 后，通过 Isaac Lab 启动器运行配置命令："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:79
msgid ""
"The ``setup_python_env`` task in the command palette runs the recommended "
"``uv`` workflow."
msgstr "命令面板中的 ``setup_python_env`` 任务采用推荐的 ``uv`` 工作流。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:82
msgid "The command creates or updates these machine-local files:"
msgstr "该命令创建或更新以下本机文件："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:84
msgid ""
"``.vscode/launch.json``: Debugging configurations. An existing file is "
"preserved."
msgstr "``.vscode/launch.json`` ：调试配置。已有文件会保留。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:85
msgid "``.vscode/settings.json``: The interpreter and shared editor settings."
msgstr "``.vscode/settings.json`` ：解释器及共享编辑器设置。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:86
msgid ""
"``pyrightconfig.json``: Import paths for Pyright-compatible language "
"servers."
msgstr "``pyrightconfig.json`` ：兼容 Pyright 的语言服务器所需导入路径。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:88
msgid ""
"The generated files are ignored by Git because interpreter and extension "
"paths vary between machines. Rerun the command after changing Python "
"environments or Isaac Sim installations. If Isaac Sim is not installed, the "
"command prints a warning and still configures the local Isaac Lab packages."
msgstr ""
"不同机器的解释器和扩展路径不同，因此生成文件由 Git 忽略。更换 Python 环境或 Isaac Sim 安装后，应重新运行命令。如果未安装 "
"Isaac Sim，命令会打印警告，但仍会配置本地 Isaac Lab 包。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:93
msgid ""
"The checked-in ``[tool.pyright]`` table in ``pyproject.toml`` makes packages"
" under ``source`` available immediately after cloning. The generated "
"``pyrightconfig.json`` inherits that policy and adds Isaac Sim extensions "
"plus Isaac Lab packages found in the active Python environment. This covers "
"source, editable, and wheel installations without storing absolute paths in "
"Git."
msgstr ""
"``pyproject.toml`` 中已纳入版本控制的 ``[tool.pyright]`` 表，使克隆后即可解析 ``source`` "
"下的包。生成的 ``pyrightconfig.json`` 继承该配置，并添加 Isaac Sim 扩展以及当前 Python 环境中的 Isaac "
"Lab 包。这覆盖源码、可编辑和 wheel 安装，无需将绝对路径存入 Git。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:100
msgid "Configure VS Code"
msgstr "配置 VS Code"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:102
msgid ""
"Install the extensions recommended by the repository when VS Code prompts "
"you. At minimum, install the Python and Pylance extensions. Run the setup "
"command above, then use **Python: Select Interpreter** from the command "
"palette to select the same interpreter used by the command. For the "
"recommended uv installation, this is ``.venv/bin/python`` on Linux or "
"``.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe`` on Windows."
msgstr ""
"VS Code 提示时，安装仓库推荐的扩展，至少安装 Python 和 Pylance。运行上述配置命令后，通过命令面板的 **Python: "
"Select Interpreter** 选择执行该命令的同一解释器。推荐的 uv 安装在 Linux 下对应 ``.venv/bin/python``"
" ，在 Windows 下对应 ``.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:109
msgid "Configure Cursor"
msgstr "配置 Cursor"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:111
msgid ""
"Cursor cannot use Pylance because Pylance is licensed for official VS Code "
"builds. Install the Python extension and the `basedpyright "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=detachhead.basedpyright>`__"
" extension (``detachhead.basedpyright``). Then:"
msgstr ""
"Cursor 无法使用 Pylance，因为 Pylance 的许可仅允许官方 VS Code 构建使用。请安装 Python 扩展和 "
"`basedpyright "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=detachhead.basedpyright>`__"
" 扩展（ ``detachhead.basedpyright`` ），然后："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:116
msgid "Run the same setup command shown above for your installation."
msgstr "根据安装方式运行上面的同一配置命令。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:117
msgid "Select the interpreter that ran the command."
msgstr "选择运行该命令的解释器。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:118
msgid ""
"Reload the Cursor window so basedpyright rereads ``pyrightconfig.json``."
msgstr "重新加载 Cursor 窗口，让 basedpyright 重新读取 ``pyrightconfig.json`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:120
msgid ""
"No Cursor-specific path list is required. Pylance and basedpyright read the "
"same Pyright configuration."
msgstr "无需 Cursor 专用路径列表。Pylance 和 basedpyright 读取同一份 Pyright 配置。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:124
msgid "Troubleshoot editor imports"
msgstr "排查编辑器导入问题"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:126
msgid "If an import is still unresolved:"
msgstr "如果某个导入仍无法解析："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:128
msgid ""
"Confirm the selected editor interpreter matches ``python`` in the setup "
"command."
msgstr "确认编辑器所选解释器与配置命令中的 ``python`` 一致。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:129
msgid ""
"Rerun setup with ``uv run --extra isaacsim isaaclab --editor`` if the "
"missing import is from ``omni``, ``pxr``, or ``isaacsim``."
msgstr ""
"如果缺少的导入来自 ``omni`` 、 ``pxr`` 或 ``isaacsim`` ，使用 ``uv run --extra isaacsim "
"isaaclab --editor`` 重新配置。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:131
msgid "Reload the editor window."
msgstr "重新加载编辑器窗口。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:132
msgid ""
"Inspect the generated ``extraPaths`` in the root ``pyrightconfig.json``."
msgstr "检查根目录 ``pyrightconfig.json`` 中生成的 ``extraPaths`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:134
msgid ""
"Remove simulator extension directories that the project does not use if "
"language-server indexing consumes too much memory."
msgstr "如果语言服务器索引占用过多内存，移除项目未使用的仿真器扩展目录。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:137
msgid "For more information about VS Code support in Isaac Sim, see:"
msgstr "Isaac Sim 对 VS Code 的支持，更多信息见："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:139
msgid ""
"`Isaac Sim VSCode support "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/development_tools/vscode.html#visual-"
"studio-code-vs-code>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Isaac Sim VSCode 支持 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/development_tools/vscode.html#visual-"
"studio-code-vs-code>`__"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:143
msgid "Attach to a Running ``debugpy`` Session"
msgstr "附加到正在运行的 ``debugpy`` 会话"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:145
msgid ""
"The generated ``.vscode/launch.json`` includes a ``Python: Debugger Attach``"
" configuration that starts to listen on port ``localhost:3000`` for the "
"debugpy session."
msgstr ""
"生成的 ``.vscode/launch.json`` 包含 ``Python: Debugger Attach`` 配置，通过 "
"``localhost:3000`` 端口连接 debugpy 会话。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:148
msgid "To use it:"
msgstr "使用步骤："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:150
msgid "Set your breakpoints."
msgstr "设置断点。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:151
msgid "Run your code under debugpy like so:"
msgstr "按以下方式通过 debugpy 运行代码："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:167
msgid ""
"In VS Code, select the ``Python: Debugger Attach`` configuration from the "
"Run and Debug panel and press the green play button or ``F5``. VS Code will "
"connect to the debugpy server running on ``localhost:3000``."
msgstr ""
"在 VS Code 的运行和调试面板中选择 ``Python: Debugger Attach`` ，点击绿色运行按钮或按 ``F5`` 。VS "
"Code 会连接运行于 ``localhost:3000`` 的 debugpy 服务器。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:172
msgid "Configuring the Python interpreter"
msgstr "配置 Python 解释器"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:174
msgid ""
"The setup command records the interpreter that ran it in "
"``.vscode/settings.json``. For example, a uv source checkout on Linux uses:"
msgstr "配置命令会将执行它的解释器记录在 ``.vscode/settings.json`` 中。例如，Linux 上的 uv 源码检出目录使用："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:183
msgid ""
"The editor selection takes precedence over this default. If you change "
"environments, rerun setup and select the new interpreter from the status bar"
" or with **Python: Select Interpreter** in the command palette."
msgstr ""
"编辑器中的选择优先于此默认值。更换环境后，应重新配置，并通过状态栏或命令面板的 **Python: Select Interpreter** "
"选择新解释器。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:187
msgid ""
"The generated launch configurations always run this recorded interpreter. VS"
" Code resolves wrapper scripts such as ``_isaac_sim/python.sh`` to the "
"underlying Python executable, which skips the environment setup that Isaac "
"Sim requires. If ``.vscode/launch.json`` already exists, setup preserves it;"
" add ``\"python\": \"${config:python.defaultInterpreterPath}\"`` to each "
"configuration, or delete the file and rerun setup to regenerate it."
msgstr ""
"生成的启动配置始终运行所记录的解释器。VS Code 会将 ``_isaac_sim/python.sh`` 等包装脚本解析为底层 Python "
"可执行文件，跳过 Isaac Sim 必需的环境设置。如果 ``.vscode/launch.json`` 已存在，配置过程会保留它；请向每个配置添加 "
"``\"python\": \"${config:python.defaultInterpreterPath}\"`` "
"，或删除文件后重新运行配置命令生成。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:194
msgid ""
"For more information about selecting a Python interpreter, see the `VS Code "
"documentation "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/python/environments#_working-with-"
"python-interpreters>`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 Python 解释器的更多信息见 `VS Code 文档 "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/python/environments#_working-with-"
"python-interpreters>`_ 。"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:199
msgid "Setting up formatting and linting"
msgstr "设置格式化和代码检查"

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:201
msgid ""
"We use `ruff <https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/>`_ as a formatter and "
"linter. These are configured in the ``.vscode/settings.json`` file:"
msgstr ""
"我们使用 `ruff <https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/>`_ 作为格式化工具和代码检查工具。这些在 "
"``.vscode/settings.json`` 文件中进行配置："

#: source/developer-tools/editor_setup.rst:210
msgid ""
"The ruff linter will show warnings and errors in your code to help you "
"follow Python best practices and the project's coding standards."
msgstr "ruff 代码检查工具将在您的代码中显示警告和错误，以帮助您遵循 Python 最佳实践和项目的编码标准。"
